{"sha": "a1ff5f802c82760946e1cec627f0ad4918bd21356baa88f967dedbfd97dae178", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g9:metals-acids-corrosion} 章 --- 金属：与酸的反应和腐蚀}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:1}", "氢气：将点燃的木条靠近试管口，发出爆鸣声。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:2}", "铁、锌和铝能发生反应；铜和金则不能。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:3}", "氧气和水两者都需要。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:4}", "反应中存在但不参与反应的离子。以", "盐酸为例：氯离子 \\ce{Cl-}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:5}", "\\ce{Mg(s) + 2H+(aq) -> Mg^{2+}(aq) + H2(g)}；反应前后两侧电荷均为 $+2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:6}", "加入氢氧化钠，生成绿色沉淀 \\ce{Fe(OH)2}，", "说明存在亚铁离子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:7}", "煮沸可除去水中溶解的空气，油层则阻止空气", "再次溶入水中：铁钉处有水，却没有氧气。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:8}", "溶解在水中的盐溅到汽车上，会加快生锈。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:9}", "形成的氧化层附着在金属上，将金属与空气隔开：", "腐蚀只停留在表面。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:10}", "涂漆、涂油或涂脂，或镀锌（或用不锈钢制造）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:11}", "\\ce{2Al(s) + 6H+(aq) -> 2Al^{3+}(aq) + 3H2(g)}：两侧均有 2 个 Al 和 6 个 H，", "电荷均为 $+6$。对 200 个 Al 原子而言：$200 \\times \\frac{3}{2} = 300$", "个氢气分子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:12}", "划痕周围的锌先于钢被腐蚀，", "只要附近仍有锌，钢便得以保护。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g9:metals-acids-corrosion:1}", "\\textbf{1.} \\ce{Zn(s) + 2H+(aq) -> Zn^{2+}(aq) + H2(g)}。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 氢气：点燃的木条靠近时发出爆鸣声。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 加入氢氧化钠后生成白色沉淀", "\\ce{Zn(OH)2}。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 氯离子 \\ce{Cl-}。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $125.6 - 113.5 = \\qty{12.1}{g}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 只要锌与酸反应，就持续放出氢气；", "锌耗尽后，气泡便停止产生。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 钢中的铁也会反应，生成氢气和", "\\ce{Fe^{2+}} 离子；加入氢氧化钠后会生成绿色沉淀。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 锌先于钢被腐蚀，使钢", "与水和空气隔绝。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $2 \\times 10.0 \\times 10.0 = \\qty{200}{cm^2}$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $12.1 \\div 7.13 \\approx \\qty{1.70}{cm^3}$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $1.70 \\div 200 = \\qty{0.0085}{cm}$。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $0.0085 \\times 10\\,000 = \\qty{85}{\\micro m}$：锌层", "厚约 \\qty{85}{\\micro m}。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}